%% Parallel Query Architecture
%% Shows the complete lifecycle of parallel query execution including
%% DSM setup, worker launch, tuple flow, and instrumentation reporting.
%%
%% Source: src/backend/executor/execParallel.c
%%         src/backend/executor/nodeGather.c
%%         src/backend/executor/nodeGatherMerge.c

sequenceDiagram
    participant Planner
    participant Leader as Leader Process
    participant DSM as DSM Segment
    participant W1 as Worker 1
    participant W2 as Worker 2

    Note over Planner,Leader: Planning Phase
    Planner->>Leader: PlannedStmt with Gather node<br>(nworkers=2)

    Note over Leader,DSM: Initialization Phase (lazy, on first ExecProcNode)
    Leader->>Leader: ExecInitGather()
    Leader->>Leader: ExecInitParallelPlan()

    Leader->>DSM: ExecSerializePlan()<br>Store serialized PlannedStmt

    Leader->>DSM: ExecParallelEstimate()<br>Calculate DSM size per node

    Leader->>DSM: Allocate DSM segment
    Note over DSM: Contents:<br>- FixedParallelExecutorState<br>- Serialized plan text<br>- ParamListInfo<br>- shm_mq[0] for Worker 1<br>- shm_mq[1] for Worker 2<br>- SharedExecutorInstrumentation<br>- Per-node parallel state

    Leader->>DSM: ExecParallelInitializeDSM()<br>Per-node shared state setup

    Leader->>DSM: ExecParallelSetupTupleQueues()<br>Create shm_mq per worker

    Note over Leader,W2: Worker Launch Phase
    Leader->>W1: LaunchParallelWorkers()<br>fork + RegisterDynamicBackgroundWorker
    Leader->>W2: fork

    Note over W1,W2: Worker Initialization
    W1->>DSM: ParallelQueryMain() - attach to DSM
    W1->>DSM: shm_toc_lookup(PARALLEL_KEY_PLANNEDSTMT)
    W1->>W1: stringToNode() - deserialize plan
    W1->>W1: ExecutorStart() - build PlanState tree
    W1->>DSM: ExecParallelInitializeWorker()<br>Attach to per-node shared state

    W2->>DSM: ParallelQueryMain() - attach to DSM
    W2->>W2: Deserialize + ExecutorStart()
    W2->>DSM: ExecParallelInitializeWorker()

    Note over Leader,W2: Execution Phase (concurrent)

    par Worker 1 execution
        loop Until plan exhausted
            W1->>W1: ExecProcNode() on plan subtree
            W1->>DSM: shm_mq_send(tuple) to queue[0]
        end
    and Worker 2 execution
        loop Until plan exhausted
            W2->>W2: ExecProcNode() on plan subtree
            W2->>DSM: shm_mq_send(tuple) to queue[1]
        end
    and Leader collection
        loop Until all sources exhausted
            alt Gather (unordered)
                Leader->>DSM: Round-robin: TupleQueueReaderNext()
                DSM-->>Leader: tuple from worker N
            else GatherMerge (ordered)
                Leader->>Leader: binaryheap_first() - get min
                Leader->>DSM: Replace with next from same source
                DSM-->>Leader: sorted tuple
            end
            Leader->>Leader: ExecProcNode(local plan subtree)
            Note over Leader: Also executes plan locally<br>("leader as worker")
            Leader-->>Leader: Return tuple to upper nodes
        end
    end

    Note over Leader,W2: Shutdown Phase

    W1->>DSM: Copy Instrumentation data<br>(for EXPLAIN ANALYZE)
    W1->>DSM: Report BufferUsage + WalUsage
    W1->>W1: ExecutorFinish() + ExecutorEnd()
    W1->>W1: exit()

    W2->>DSM: Copy Instrumentation data
    W2->>W2: ExecutorEnd() + exit()

    Leader->>Leader: ExecShutdownGather()
    Leader->>Leader: WaitForParallelWorkersToFinish()
    Leader->>DSM: ExecParallelRetrieveInstrumentation()<br>Aggregate per-node stats from workers
    Leader->>DSM: Detach and destroy DSM segment
